  "description": "What would the two masters have done?\n\n\"Don't ask questions, don't argue; smash their heads.\"\n\n\"True chivalry is leaving a shred of mercy.\"\n\nA joint disciple raised by two absolute masters representing the Black and White paths, Cheon Woo-jin wields the Wol-a-bong and Hak-u-seon to pacify the Central Plains martial arts world with overwhelming power. The chronicle of the sleeping dragon Cheon Woo-jin traversing the martial world to prevent the return of the great evil, the Dark Emperor!\n\n_Source: Naver, Translated_",
